"description":"WhoLiked? is the funniest game to reveal your friends' true personalities.\n\nGuess which funny video your friends liked on socials — and what they think you would've liked.\n\nThis party app leaks your friends' liked videos one by one. \nEvery minute, a video pops up, and the group has to guess who liked it. \nThe best game to discover the true personalities of players.\nThe best way to see what your friends really think of you. \nExpect wild laughs, unexpected truths, fun icebreakers… and just the right amount of drama.\n\nThe game is simple. Add all your friends to a party, discover weird, funny or embarrassing videos, and wait to see WHO LIKED. \nEveryone downloads the app and joins with a PIN — one player creates the gameand shares it with the group. \nPerfect for in-person and remote group parties.\n\nOne video shows up every minute, and everyone guesses who in the group liked it.\n\nIt can be:\n  • A secret crush\n  • An embarrassing video\n  • A weird hobby\n\nPerfect for pre-drinks, afters, sleepovers, fun group activities for adults, roasting your besties, revealing your crush's likes, or laughing until it hurts. \nIt's the new way to play truth or dare, never have I ever — without needing cards or dares.\n\nWhoLiked is:\n  - A new way of looking at party games\n  - A game based on each player's social behavior\n  - An amazing icebreaker\n  - A clash generator\n\n\nThis app contains a subscription:\n  - Subscribe to unlock premium features and unlimited games\n  - Subscription options: a one-time Party Pass or a weekly premium\n  subscription\n\n- Terms of Use: https://irl-apps.notion.site/Terms-of-use-27e2a3dc537c8161a2c8c23ec0e20eaf\n- Privacy Policy: https://irl-apps.notion.site/Privacy-Policy-EN-36f2a3dc537c812f8f0be65efddb2c0f", "bundleId":"co.jointhequest.wholiked", "genres":["Games", "Entertainment", "Trivia", "Casual"], "userRatingCount":8266}]
